{"ref":"BDB, חֵ֫שֶׁק","hw":"חֵ֫שֶׁק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫שֶׁק</span></big>  <strong>n.m. desire</strong> = thing desired—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵשֶׁק שְׁלֹמֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.19\">1 Kg 9:19</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.6\">2 Ch 8:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.1\">1 K 9:1</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶשֶׁף חִשְׁקִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.4\">Is 21:4</a> <em>the twilight of my pleasure</em>.","next":"BDB, חָשׁוּק","prev":"BDB, חָשַׁק"}